  "goodToKnow": "Brisant means explosive or highly sensitive, of topics and information: ein brisantes Thema, brisante Enthüllungen. Die Brisanz is explosiveness: Das Thema gewinnt an Brisanz. It originally described explosives with high shattering power, from French briser (to break). Synonyms: heikel, explosiv, spannungsgeladen. Don't confuse it with brillant (brilliant)."
